  "solution": {
    "text": "Divisible by six means divisible by <math><mn>2</mn></math> as well as <math><mn>3</mn><mo>.</mo></math><br />(i) Case-1: without <math><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>_</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mo>_</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mo>_</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mo>_</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><munder underaccent=\"false\"><mrow><mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mo>/</mo><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>_</mo></munder></math><br />So, we have to put <math><mn>2</mn></math> or <math><mn>4</mn></math> in ones place.<br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo></math> Number of ways <math><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><munder underaccent=\"false\"><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow><mo>_</mo></munder><mo>&#215;</mo><munder underaccent=\"false\"><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mo>_</mo></munder><mo>&#215;</mo><munder underaccent=\"false\"><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mo>_</mo></munder><mo>&#215;</mo><munder underaccent=\"false\"><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo>_</mo></munder><mo>&#215;</mo><munder underaccent=\"false\"><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mo>_</mo></munder><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>!</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>48</mn></math><br />(ii) Case-2: without <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn></math> at ones place<br /><math><mo>_</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mo>_</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mo>_</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mo>_</mo><munder underaccent=\"false\"><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><mo>_</mo></munder><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>!</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mn>4</mn></math><br />(ii) Case-2: without <math><mn>3</mn></math> and <math><mn>2</mn></math> or <math><mn>4</mn></math> at ones place<br /><math><mo>_</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mo>_</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mo>_</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mo>_</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><munder underaccent=\"false\"><mrow><mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mo>/</mo><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>_</mo></munder><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mn>6</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo></math> Total number of ways <math><mo>=</mo><mn>48</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>24</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>36</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>108</mn></math>",
